 ## Background
 The concept of block transformation coding for volume rendering was introduced to address the difficulties of rendering large datasets on GPUs [S1]. Fout and Ma proposed a real-time volume compression and decompression technique based on block transformation coding for use in GPU-based raycasting pipelines [S1].
